                  {
                    "value": "How to read this page",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#4B2D83"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Real: ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#1B1F27"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Skills by volume (left) are observed Purview plugin invocations with curated plain-English names. Estimated hours saved by category (right) applies the selected cited time-saved basis to observed tasks and does not require a labor rate. Dollar-value cards use those hours multiplied by the explicitly selected customer labor rate. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#1B1F27"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Unavailable today: ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#1B1F27"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Value by department (middle) requires a matching customer Entra/HR export at OrgCsvPath and a selected customer labor-rate input; it stays blank until both are available. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#1B1F27"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Take action: ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#1B1F27"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "use the skill and category views today; the department view activates once org data connects.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#1B1F27"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
